    "category": "image",
    "subcategory": "per-model-quirks",
    "principle": "Declarative spec of every image-gen model's input quirks. The composer reads this catalog and shapes the request body accordingly — backends are consumers, not authors, of model-specific knowledge. Add a new model by editing JSON; do NOT scatter quirks across backend code.",
    "sources": [
      "OpenAI image generation guide (negative-prompt = natural-language for GPT Image 2)",
      "Google Imagen prompt guide 2026 (separate negative_prompt field, plain nouns)",
      "Black Forest Labs FLUX prompting guide (positive rewrite > negation)",
      "FLUX Kontext editing guide (preserve/change clauses)",
      "Midjourney official docs (--no parameter for negatives)",
      "Runway Gen-4 prompting guide (positive phrasing only, avoid negation)",
      "EvoLink GPT Image 2 OpenAPI spec 2026-05-04",
      "WaveSpeed Imagen 4 API error log 2026-05-04 (allowedAspects discovered empirically)"
    ],
    "interpolation_rule": "Items in this library are NOT prompt fragments — they're INPUT-SHAPING spec. The composer reads `negative_compile_strategy` etc. and builds the request body / prompt accordingly. Backend code does NOT consult these directly; it receives params from the composer."
  },
